:157172":{"cacheId":"157172","imageId":"157172","imageLabel":"","imageTag":"","imageUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Flilianaar.vtexassets.com\u002Farquivos\u002Fids\u002F157172\u002FCI650_01.jpg?v=638774097520130000","imageText":"CI650_01","__typename":"Image"},"Image:157173":{"cacheId":"157173","imageId":"157173","imageLabel":"HOVER","imageTag":"","imageUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Flilianaar.vtexassets.com\u002Farquivos\u002Fids\u002F157173\u002FCI650_02.jpg?v=638833895443370000","imageText":"CI650_02","__typename":"Image"},"Image:157174":{"cacheId":"157174","imageId":"157174","imageLabel":"","imageTag":"","imageUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Flilianaar.vtexassets.com\u002Farquivos\u002Fids\u002F157174\u002FCI650_03.jpg?v=638833895443530000","imageText":"CI650_03","__typename":"Image"},"Image:157175":{"cacheId":"157175","imageId":"157175","imageLabel":"","imageTag":"","imageUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Flilianaar.vtexassets.com\u002Farquivos\u002Fids\u002F157175\u002FCI650_04.jpg?v=638833895443530000","imageText":"CI650_04","__typename":"Image"},"Image:157176":{"cacheId":"157176","imageId":"157176","imageLabel":"","imageTag":"","imageUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Flilianaar.vtexassets.com\u002Farquivos\u002Fids\u002F157176\u002FCI650_05.jpg?v=638833895443530000","imageText":"CI650_05","__typename":"Image"},"Product:sp-25-ci650.items({}).0.sellers.0":{"sellerId":"1","sellerName":"Tienda Liliana Argentina","sellerDefault":true,"__typename":"Seller","commertialOffer":{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"$Product:sp-25-ci650.items({}).0.sellers.0.commertialOffer","typename":"Offer"}},"$Product:sp-25-ci650.items({}).0.sellers.0.commertialOffer":{"discountHighlights":[],"teasers":[],"Price":157999,"ListPrice":157999,"Tax":0,"taxPercentage":0,"spotPrice":157999,"PriceWithoutDiscount":157999,"RewardValue":0,"PriceValidUntil":"2027-08-04T17:16:26Z","AvailableQuantity":10000,"__typename":"Offer","Installments({})":[{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"$Product:sp-25-ci650.items({}).0.sellers.0.commertialOffer.Installments({}).0","typename":"Installment"}]},"$Product:sp-25-ci650.items({}).0.sellers.0.commertialOffer.Installments({}).0":{"Value":52667,"InterestRate":0,"TotalValuePlusInterestRate":157999,"NumberOfInstallments":3,"Name":"American Express 3 vezes sem juros","PaymentSystemName":"American Express","__typename":"Installment"},"Product:sp-37-cfb17":{"advertisement":null,"cacheId":"sp-37-cfb17","productId":"37","description":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EConvector CONVECTORY PLUS - Modelo CFB17\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cbr \u002F\u003E&iexcl;Calefacci&oacute;n r&aacute;pida y eficiente para tu hogar! El&nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003EConvector CONVECTORY PLUS\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;es un equipo moderno y seguro que convierte el aire fr&iacute;o en c&aacute;lido en pocos minutos, gracias a su&nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003Eforzador de aire\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;y su&nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003Egran poder cal&oacute;rico\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. Con dise&ntilde;o decorativo y funciones avanzadas, es ideal para mantener tu espacio c&oacute;modo y acogedor durante los d&iacute;as m&aacute;s fr&iacute;os. &iexcl;Disfrut&aacute; del calor con la calidad de la industria argentina!\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Chr \u002F\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EConvector CONVECTORY PLUS: Calor r&aacute;pido y seguro\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEste convector est&aacute; dise&ntilde;ado para ofrecer un&nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003Ecalor uniforme y eficiente\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E, con un&nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003Etermostato regulable\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;que te permite ahorrar energ&iacute;a. Adem&aacute;s, su&nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003Eselector de temperatura con 3 intensidades\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;te brinda control total sobre el nivel de calor que necesit&aacute;s.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Chr \u002F\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEspecificaciones t&eacute;cnicas y funcionalidades\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EForzador de aire:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Recircula el aire del ambiente, calent&aacute;ndolo r&aacute;pidamente.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDise&ntilde;o moderno y decorativo:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Se adapta a cualquier estilo de decoraci&oacute;n.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETermostato regulable:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Ahorra energ&iacute;a mientras mantiene la temperatura deseada.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESelector de temperatura:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;3 intensidades de calor (750 W, 1.250 W, 2.000 W).\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMedidas:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;60 cm (base) x 40 cm (altura) x 21 cm (profundidad).\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Chr \u002F\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETotalmente seguro\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEl&nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003EConvector CONVECTORY PLUS\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;est&aacute; dise&ntilde;ado pensando en tu seguridad:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EParedes fr&iacute;as:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Seguro al tacto, incluso despu&eacute;s de horas de uso.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENo consume ox&iacute;geno:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Mantiene la calidad del aire en tu hogar.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMayor aislaci&oacute;n el&eacute;ctrica:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Reduce riesgos el&eacute;ctricos.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECorte de seguridad:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Por ca&iacute;da o sobrecalentamiento.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Chr \u002F\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGarant&iacute;a y confianza\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEste convector cuenta con una&nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003Egarant&iacute;a de 2 a&ntilde;os\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E, respaldando su durabilidad y rendimiento. Con el sello de la&nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003Eindustria argentina\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E, pod&eacute;s confiar en un producto de calidad y eficiencia.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Chr \u002F\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&iquest;Por qu&eacute; elegir el Convector CONVECTORY PLUS?\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalor r&aacute;pido y uniforme:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Forzador de aire para un calentamiento eficiente.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E3 intensidades de calor:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Adaptable a tus necesidades.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDise&ntilde;o moderno:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Decorativo y funcional.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESeguridad avanzada:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Paredes fr&iacute;as, corte por ca&iacute;da y sobrecalentamiento.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAhorro de energ&iacute;a:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Termostato regulable para un uso eficiente.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGarant&iacute;a de 2 a&ntilde;os:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;Confianza y respaldo.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Chr \u002F\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi busc&aacute;s un equipo de calefacci&oacute;n&nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003Eeficiente, seguro y moderno\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E, el&nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003EConvector CONVECTORY PLUS - Modelo CFB17\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E&nbsp;es tu mejor opci&oacute;n. &iexcl;Disfrut&aacute; del calor en tu hogar con un producto de calidad argentina!\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","productName":"Convector Convectory Plus","productReference":"CCCFB17","linkText":"convector-convectory-plus","brand":"Liliana","brandId":2000000,"link":"\u002Fconvector-convectory-plus\u002Fp","categories":{"type":"json","json":["\u002FCalefacción\u002FConvectores\u002F","\u002FCalefacción\u002F"]},"categoryId":"11","releaseDate":"1752710400000","priceRange":{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"$Product:sp-37-cfb17.priceRange","typename":"ProductPriceRange"},"specificationGroups":[{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.specificationGroups.0","typename":"SpecificationGroup"},{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.specificationGroups.1","typename":"SpecificationGroup"}],"skuSpecifications":[],"productClusters":[{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.productClusters.0","typename":"ProductClusters"},{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.productClusters.1","typename":"ProductClusters"},{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.productClusters.2","typename":"ProductClusters"},{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.productClusters.3","typename":"ProductClusters"},{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.productClusters.4","typename":"ProductClusters"},{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.productClusters.5","typename":"ProductClusters"},{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.productClusters.6","typename":"ProductClusters"},{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.productClusters.7","typename":"ProductClusters"},{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.productClusters.8","typename":"ProductClusters"},{"type":"id","generated":true,"id":"Product:sp-37-cfb17.p